Saya... sepatutnya memberi perhatian lebih
semasa anda berada di stesen

522
00:55:37.667 --> 00:55:39.127
dan menawarkan lebih banyak bantuan kepada anda.

523
00:55:40.086 --> 00:55:41.338
Ia adalah kesilapan saya.

524
00:55:46.593 --> 00:55:47.469
Eh...

525
00:55:50.513 --> 00:55:52.098
Maybe you want some water?

526
00:56:06.321 --> 00:56:07.864
- Ini awak.
- Oh.

527
00:56:08.948 --> 00:56:09.949
Terima kasih puan.

528
00:56:11.201 --> 00:56:14.829
On the night in question,
you were picked up on someone's dashcam.

529
00:56:15.330 --> 00:56:17.165
Pretty near the scene of the murder.

530
00:56:21.336 --> 00:56:22.461
You were seen in the garage,

531
00:56:22.462 --> 00:56:24.506
dan saya ingin tahu
what you were doing there.

532
00:56:26.341 --> 00:56:28.343
There was something I needed in the car.

533
00:56:29.469 --> 00:56:34.015
It says your car wasn't in the garage,
but in the outdoor near your building.

534
00:56:34.599 --> 00:56:35.975
Di mana anda biasanya meletak kereta.

535
00:56:37.727 --> 00:56:40.813
Um, I meant to say I was getting something
dari kereta suami saya.

536
00:56:40.814 --> 00:56:42.524
He always parks it down there.

537
00:56:43.108 --> 00:56:45.567
He worries it'll get scratched
kalau kat luar.

538
00:56:45.568 --> 00:56:46.736
Ah.

539
00:56:49.781 --> 00:56:50.989
Itu sahaja untuk saya.

540
00:56:50.990 --> 00:56:53.158
If you think of anything, give me a call.

541
00:56:53.159 --> 00:56:55.202
Dan saya akan kembali
if I need more information.

542
00:56:55.203 --> 00:56:56.537
Baiklah. terima kasih.

543
00:56:59.457 --> 00:57:00.875
Eh, satu perkara terakhir.

544
00:57:03.962 --> 00:57:05.588
